<view class="container">
  <view class="card muted">
    对应设计稿「参数修正」画板——这是传感器读数的校准偏移量，不是修正已有的出入库记录。
    "保存到手机"是纯本地存储，可以真的保存；"保存到控制器"需要下发给设备，协议里目前没有对应方法。
  </view>

  <view class="card">
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">罐号</text>
      <picker mode="selector" range="{{tankOptions}}" value="{{tankIndex}}" bindchange="onTankChange">
        <view class="field-input">{{tankOptions[tankIndex] || '请选择'}}</view>
      </picker>
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">液位修正（毫米）</text>
      <input class="field-input" type="number" value="{{levelOffset}}" bindinput="onLevelInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">水位修正（毫米）</text>
      <input class="field-input" type="number" value="{{waterOffset}}" bindinput="onWaterInput" />
    </view>
    <view class="field">
      <text class="field-label">温度修正（℃）</text>
      <input class="field-input" type="number" value="{{tempOffset}}" bindinput="onTempInput" />
    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="row" style="gap:16rpx;">
    <button class="btn-primary" style="flex:1;" bindtap="onSaveLocal">保存到手机</button>
    <button class="btn-secondary" style="flex:1;" bindtap="onSaveDevice">保存到控制器</button>
  </view>
</view>
